"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, fez.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. HAT will be installed into the game's core folder and 'hat_install.bat' will be executed which will create 'MONOMODDED_FEZ.exe'. The AP Mod .zip folder will be installed inside the FEZ\\Mods directory.",
